10th Anniversary Edition!
Added the Nebula of Lost Futures, a new level for Super Toad Warriors remixing the game's level mechanic;
Fixed the jumping on enemies hurting toad glitch, and added more daredevil mode sprite replacements.

Crab Crawl is a short, single-player game that has you guiding a hungry crab from its cave into the wider Chesapeake Bay in search of morsels of food to eat. The waters are alive with hungry catfish, voracious bluegill, and mindless jellyfish who twirl around the salty currents, grabbing whatever prey bumbles their way.

Key features:

Bright, cartoony, hand-drawn art;

An expressive soundtrack to scuttle along to;

No penalty for getting caught, and overall a design appropriate for most ages and skill levels;

Surprising encounters with sea creatures, enemy crabs, and polluting fishermen.

Find all the food to complete the game, and flee a terrifying predator while saving the bay from its greatest threat!

Embark on this memorable experience with a relaxing soundtrack and unique visuals that will leave you extremely satisfied.
The three games consist of correctly fitting the cubes into specific places so you can progress in the game.
Features of both:

40 levels;
Original soundtrack;
Satisfying puzzles;
LowPoly.

The Lay D Denton project is an effort to provide a full seamless female JC Denton experience for original Deus Ex. Features include:
- A complete female JC voiceover by Karen Rohan with over 1,700 recorded lines;
- Female JC model;
- All pronouns and gender references modified;
- Additional minor characters, and scene changes appropriate to a female JC.

Tony Hawk's Pro Skater 3+4 is a remake of the two skateboarding games originally released in the early 2000s. Players perform tricks, complete objectives, and explore varied skate parks across global locations. The gameplay emphasizes fluid controls, combo chaining, and arcade-style challenges. Each title features a roster of professional skaters, along with customizable characters and gear. The collection preserves the core mechanics of the originals while offering updated visuals and performance on modern platforms.

The Digital Deluxe Edition includes:
- The Doom Slayer and The Revenant playable skaters, each including two secret moves. The Doom Slayer includes 2 unique outfits and the Unmaykr Hoverboard skate deck;
- Additional songs included with the in-game soundtrack;
- Exclusive Doom Slayer, Revenant, and Create-a-Skater skate decks;
- Exclusive themed Create-a-Skater items.
